> 3. svrmgrm wouldn't start even under Motif GUI with "Oracle toolkit
> error".
> 
We found (DU 4.0, Oracle 7.3.sth), that this error can be removed via
changing color allocation mode on workstation. The default mode is
TrueColor which causes this error. In both PseudoColor and DirectColor
svrmgrm works well (in DirectColor netscape dumps core, so I finished in
PseudoColor).
Those modes can be changed in /usr/lib/X11/Xserver.conf via giving in 
<- Gateye Options section
option -vclass0 PseudoColor
to X.



