Kjell Andresen wrote:

>    Does any one know if there is a FAQ (or web page) somewhere covering
>    tips/issues/possible problems  related to upgrading from DU 3.2c to 4.0?
>    We are planning to do an "/sbin/installupdate".
>
> It's a chapter in the installations manual(s).
> You will have to go to v3.2G first and then to v4.0B.
>

Not according to the Installation Guide for V4.0B. The recommended route from
V3.2C is toV4.0, then to V4.0B.  If you go V3.2C==>V3.2G, you still have to go
via V4.0 or V4.0A before you
can get to V4.0B (ie. 3 steps rather than 2).
From my experiences of going V3.2G==>V4.0A==>V4.0B, you should first increase
the root
partition - V4.0x requires a significantly larger one. Under V3.2x I found
64MB was adequate,
under V4.0x, double this if you have the space (though I'm using 96MB
comfortably).

Regards,
John Hill

