Well, I'm not sure about DEC3000, but I have DEC5000. DEC5000 is not an
AXP architecture, but MIPS. If DEC3000 is 32-bit, then it's MIPS. You
cannot put DEC OSF/1 or Digital UNIX on it, only ULTRIX.
 
