Let me put it to you this way.  As an engineer I'm conerned with
how much work I can get done in a give amount of time.  I don't
care if the CPU design is clever or brute force.  As long as
it allows me to get my work done as fast as possible (and 
perferrably at low cost) I'm happy.  What good is a 'clever'
design if its overall performance slower and costs more money ?

