Well, after a day of tinkering I did end up fixing this.
	My somaxconn was set to its default (1024) as was my sominconn (0). 
Using a combination of dbx -k /vmunix, sysconfig, and sysconfigdb, I was
able to set them both to their maximum values of 32767.  Granted, once I
get this box patched up to 4.0D, I should be able to set them higher,
but these settings seem to be working for now.
	If anyone would like more detail on this, feel free to email me.

Regards,
